## Why This Is Asked

Evaluates ability to design an end-to-end, cross-region, cross-account data pipeline using CDK, Gatekeeper, and canary deployment, with focus on security, reliability, and cost control.

## Key Concepts

- Cross-account IAM roles and least privilege
- CDK multi-region deployments
- Gatekeeper policy checks for resources and IAM
- Canary routing with Route 53
- Data lag monitoring and autotrollable rollback
- Observability: CloudWatch, X-Ray, dashboards

